* ACTIVITY_MESSAGE_RECEIVED: An activity received a message.\n\
* ACTIVITY_SIGNALED: An activity received a signal\n\
* ACTIVITY_STARTED: An activity is starting to execute\n\
* ENGINE_CLOSED: The process-engine this listener is attached to has been closed.\n\
* ENGINE_CREATED: The process-engine this listener is attached to has been created and is ready for API-calls.\n\
