* ENTITY_CREATED: A new entity is created.\n\
* ENTITY_DELETED: An existing entity is deleted.\n\
* ENTITY_INITIALIZED: A new entity has been created and is fully initialized.\n\
* ENTITY_SUSPENDED: An existing entity is suspended.\n\
* ENTITY_UPDATED: An existing entity is updated.\n\
* JOB_EXECUTION_FAILURE: The execution of a job has failed.\n\
* JOB_EXECUTION_SUCCESS: A job has been executed successfully.\n\
* JOB_RETRIES_DECREMENTED: The number of job retries have been decremented due to a failed job.\n\
* MEMBERSHIP_CREATED: A user has been added to a group.\n\
* MEMBERSHIP_DELETED: A user has been removed from a group.\n\
* MEMBERSHIPS_DELETED: All members will be removed from a group.\n\
* TASK_ASSIGNED: A task has been assigned to a user.\n\
* TASK_COMPLETED: A task has been completed.\n\
* TIMER_FIRED: A timer has been fired.\n\
* UNCAUGHT_BPMN_ERROR: An uncaught BPMN Error has been thrown.\n\
* VARIABLE_CREATED: A variable has been created.\n\
* VARIABLE_DELETED: An existing variable has been deleted.\n\
* VARIABLE_UPDATED: An existing variable has been updated.
